# Note: You need to generate an App Password for your Gmail account to use Nodemailer.
# 1. Go to your Google Account settings.
# 2. Enable 2-Step Verification.
# 3. Go to "App passwords", generate a new password for "Mail" on "Other (Custom name)".
# 4. Use the generated 16-character password as your EMAIL_PASS.
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-generated-app-password